    <string name="relay_label">Marcar Pro · finger to apps</string>
    <string name="relay_description">Lets your finger use the apps under the ink while the pen keeps writing, gives each browser tab its own ink, and takes the screenshot when you cut the screen out with the scissors. Marcar Pro replays only your own taps and reads only the browser\'s address bar; nothing leaves the board.</string>
    <string name="relay_title">Turn on Marcar Pro’s accessibility</string>
    <string name="relay_why_crop">Cutting the screen out onto the whiteboard needs the “Marcar Pro · finger to apps” service.</string>
    <string name="relay_why_apps">For your finger to use the apps under the ink, Marcar Pro needs the “Marcar Pro · finger to apps” service.</string>
    <string name="relay_how">Tap “Open settings”, choose “Marcar Pro · finger to apps” and turn it on. You only do this once.</string>
    <string name="relay_how_restricted">This board blocks it for apps installed from a file. Once only:\n1. In the screen that opens, tap ⋮ (top right) › “Allow restricted settings”.\n2. Try again: Marcar Pro will take you to turn on “Marcar Pro · finger to apps”.</string>
