    <string name="panel_crop_title">Cut out from the PC</string>
    <string name="panel_crop_why">Only the panel\'s own Crop can capture the PC\'s picture. Marcar Pro opens it for you and, when you save the cut-out, brings it to the whiteboard. To find that cut-out, Marcar Pro needs to see the panel\'s pictures.</string>
    <string name="panel_crop_allow">Allow</string>
    <string name="files_title">Delete the PC cut-outs</string>
    <string name="files_why">The cut-out is on the whiteboard, but the panel also keeps a copy in Notes/Mark. To delete it right away, Marcar Pro needs “All files access”: turn it on in the screen that opens. Marcar Pro only uses it to delete those cut-outs. If you leave it off, the copies stay in the folder.</string>
